      "rendered": "<p title><noscript><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"3959\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2019/03/19/colored-pencils-001/material_802/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/Material_802.png?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"600,800\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-title=\"free seamless pbr colored pencils texture\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/Material_802.png?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-3959\" title src=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/Material_802.png?resize=581%2C775&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"free seamless pbr colored pencils texture\" width=\"581\" height=\"775\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/Material_802.png?resize=225%2C300&amp;ssl=1 225w, https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/Material_802.png?resize=113%2C150&amp;ssl=1 113w, https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/Material_802.png?resize=248%2C330&amp;ssl=1 248w, https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/Material_802.png?resize=180%2C240&amp;ssl=1 180w, https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/Material_802.png?w=600&amp;ssl=1 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 581px) 100vw, 581px\"></noscript><img decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"3959\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2019/03/19/colored-pencils-001/material_802/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/Material_802.png?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"600,800\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-title=\"free seamless pbr colored pencils texture\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/Material_802.png?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-3959 lazyload\" title src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20581%20775%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" alt=\"free seamless pbr colored pencils texture\" width=\"581\" height=\"775\" srcset=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20581%20775%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E 581w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 581px) 100vw, 581px\" data-srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/Material_802.png?resize=225%2C300&amp;ssl=1 225w, https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/Material_802.png?resize=113%2C150&amp;ssl=1 113w, https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/Material_802.png?resize=248%2C330&amp;ssl=1 248w, https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/Material_802.png?resize=180%2C240&amp;ssl=1 180w, https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/Material_802.png?w=600&amp;ssl=1 600w\" data-src=\"https://3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/Material_802-225x300.png\"></p>\n<h2>Colored Pencils 001 – Free seamless texture, 1024 x 1024, with the following maps:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Diffuse</li>\n<li>Normal</li>\n<li>Displacement</li>\n<li>Roughness</li>\n<li>Ambient Occlusion</li>\n</ul>\n<p><!--more--></p>\n<blockquote><p><strong>For Tier 3 Patrons, there&#8217;s a 4K resolution uncompressed PNG version of this texture. There&#8217;s also a SBS and a SBSAR files (<a href=\"https://3dtextures.me/what-are-sbs-sbsar-files/\">what are these?</a>) for texture customization.</strong></p></blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1U5lj-8EH6VFKJ1bPuodMgNyx3ll6Vcu1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><noscript><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"3138\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2019/01/28/fabric-011/button-download/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/button-download.png?fit=1105%2C220&amp;ssl=1\"